# K7-160T-DP DDR3 pin assignment for MIG "Read XDC/UCF" import.
# All pins confirmed via prjxray-db cross-check and real-bitstream reverse
# engineering (camerlink_ddr_test.bit): plain SSTL15/DIFF_SSTL15, no DCI,
# no INTERNAL_VREF override, reset_n=SSTL15 (not LVCMOS15).

